/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133168454,imgsize-69280.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Russia kills 10 in Ukraine as Zelenskyy accuses Moscow of using N Korean missiles]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133168481.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Russian missile and drone attacks killed at least ten civilians across Ukraine on Tuesday.  President Zelenskyy accused Moscow of using North Korean ballistic missiles in strikes.  Ukraine warned Russia is exploiting its air defense interceptor shortages.  Meanwhile, Ukraine struck Russian oil facilities, causing damage and casualties.  The conflict continues with both sides expanding long-range strike capabilities.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/russia-kills-at-least-10-in-ukraine-as-zelenskyy-accuses-moscow-of-using-north-korean-missiles/articleshow/133168481.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/russia-kills-at-least-10-in-ukraine-as-zelenskyy-accuses-moscow-of-using-north-korean-missiles/articleshow/133168481.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T08:38:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133168645,imgsize-600487.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[From fast fashion to fast repairs: Clothing brands push in-store mending to draw GenZ]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133168154.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/from-fast-fashion-to-fast-repairs-clothing-brands-push-in-store-mending-to-draw-genz/articleshow/133168154.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/from-fast-fashion-to-fast-repairs-clothing-brands-push-in-store-mending-to-draw-genz/articleshow/133168154.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T07:59:06+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133168171,imgsize-179156.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[North Korea fires second ballistic missile in a week ahead of US-South Korea war drills]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133168025.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[North Korea launched a ballistic missile towards the sea on Wednesday. This marks Pyongyang's second reported missile test in less than a week. South Korea and Japan condemned the launch as a provocation. Major US-South Korea military exercises are scheduled to begin soon. North Korea continues its weapons testing program amid international concerns.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/defence/international/north-korea-fires-second-ballistic-missile-in-a-week-ahead-of-us-south-korea-war-drills/articleshow/133168025.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/defence/international/north-korea-fires-second-ballistic-missile-in-a-week-ahead-of-us-south-korea-war-drills/articleshow/133168025.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T07:50:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI defence desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133168087,imgsize-56360.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump's move to curb birthright citizenship faces legal challenge]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133168061.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trumps-move-to-curb-birthright-citizenship-faces-legal-challenge/articleshow/133168061.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trumps-move-to-curb-birthright-citizenship-faces-legal-challenge/articleshow/133168061.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T07:50:01+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133168079,imgsize-91414.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[HasanAbi Seeks Perma Ban: streamer urges Twitch, YouTube to drop Asmongold; clash spotlights hate-speech rules]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133167340.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[HasanAbi has called for Asmongold to be permanently banned from Twitch and YouTube following controversial comments that resulted in a two-week Twitch suspension. Hasan argued that Asmongold was testing the platforms’ moderation limits by refusing to apologize. He also claimed Twitch and YouTube have become more cautious about punishing controversial creators. Asmongold had not responded to Hasan’s latest remarks at the time of the report.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/hasanabi-calls-for-permanent-asmongold-ban-from-twitch-and-youtube-as-streamer-feud-explodes/articleshow/133167340.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/hasanabi-calls-for-permanent-asmongold-ban-from-twitch-and-youtube-as-streamer-feud-explodes/articleshow/133167340.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T06:10:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133167344,imgsize-111158.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mormon YouTuber Dies In Crash: podcaster killed in Utah at 27; final video dwells on afterlife]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133167293.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Mormon influencer Chandler David Hendry, 27, reportedly died in a three-vehicle crash in Lehi, Utah, on August 7. Police said witnesses reported that he ran a red light before striking two cars. The occupants of those vehicles were unharmed. Hendry had built a growing audience through faith-based content on YouTube, Instagram and TikTok. His final Instagram post focused on the afterlife, family sealings and eternal relationships.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/who-was-chandler-david-hendry-mormon-youtuber-dies-at-27-in-tragic-utah-car-crash-as-his-final-afterlife-video-leaves-followers-mourning/articleshow/133167293.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/who-was-chandler-david-hendry-mormon-youtuber-dies-at-27-in-tragic-utah-car-crash-as-his-final-afterlife-video-leaves-followers-mourning/articleshow/133167293.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T05:52:00+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133167305,imgsize-54373.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Friday Debate With Andrew Wilson: Candace Owens confirms clash; Turning Point USA claims escalate feud]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133167262.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Candace Owens confirmed that her debate with Andrew Wilson will take place Friday, with the moderator set to be revealed on her show. She also criticized what she described as Turning Point USA’s silence following her release of uncompressed photographs. Owens questioned the organization’s alleged cooperation with journalist Brandy Zadrozny and suggested it was connected to critical coverage of her. The claims have added another layer to the ongoing controversy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/candace-owens-confirms-andrew-wilson-debate-as-turning-point-usa-faces-fresh-scrutiny-over-journalist-ties/articleshow/133167262.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/candace-owens-confirms-andrew-wilson-debate-as-turning-point-usa-faces-fresh-scrutiny-over-journalist-ties/articleshow/133167262.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T05:31:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133167271,imgsize-451420.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Peter Thiel: 'First mover advantage is a trap, it's much better to be the last mover']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133165161.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-peter-thiel-first-mover-advantage-is-a-trap-its-much-better-to-be-the-last-mover/articleshow/133165161.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-peter-thiel-first-mover-advantage-is-a-trap-its-much-better-to-be-the-last-mover/articleshow/133165161.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T01:54:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133165166,imgsize-47804.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Michael Bloomberg: 'I'm not smarter than anybody else but I can outwork you', and a controversial career advice]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133164807.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-michael-bloomberg-im-not-smarter-than-anybody-else-but-i-can-outwork-you-and-a-controversial-career-advice/articleshow/133164807.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-michael-bloomberg-im-not-smarter-than-anybody-else-but-i-can-outwork-you-and-a-controversial-career-advice/articleshow/133164807.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T01:02:13+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133164844,imgsize-39930.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian student charged for killing 81-year-old man in Florida after driving Cadillac like a bullet at 100mph, attorney asks court to allow him to return to Columbia University]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133164017.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-student-charged-for-killing-81-year-old-man-in-florida-after-driving-cadillac-like-a-bullet-at-100mph-attorney-asks-court-to-allow-him-to-return-to-columbia-university/articleshow/133164017.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-student-charged-for-killing-81-year-old-man-in-florida-after-driving-cadillac-like-a-bullet-at-100mph-attorney-asks-court-to-allow-him-to-return-to-columbia-university/articleshow/133164017.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T00:28:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133164426,imgsize-44508.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Middle East standoff: Why Gulf states may accept that Iran will control the Strait of Hormuz]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133161794.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Gulf energy producers have acknowledged Iran's assertion of control over the critical Strait of Hormuz. This development occurs amidst attempts to resume passage through this essential route, which are stymied by ongoing tensions. Governments in the region prioritize peace over export delays, while Iran aims for financial easing and a prohibition of international warships, extending the disruption of global energy channels.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/middle-east-standoff-why-gulf-states-may-accept-that-iran-will-control-the-strait-of-hormuz/articleshow/133161794.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/middle-east-standoff-why-gulf-states-may-accept-that-iran-will-control-the-strait-of-hormuz/articleshow/133161794.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-11T23:19:16+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133162263,imgsize-194858.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[7-year-old found duct-taped and dead in closet in Cincinnati: Indian-American coroner says she froze for a while when she opened the door]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133161644.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/7-year-old-found-duct-taped-and-dead-in-closet-in-cincinnati-indian-american-coroner-says-she-froze-for-a-while-when-she-opened-the-door/articleshow/133161644.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/7-year-old-found-duct-taped-and-dead-in-closet-in-cincinnati-indian-american-coroner-says-she-froze-for-a-while-when-she-opened-the-door/articleshow/133161644.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-11T22:57:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133161765,imgsize-60660.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[This day in space: NASA launched first successful communications satellite in 1960]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133149673.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[On August 12, 1960, NASA launched Echo 1A, a 100-foot balloon that became its first successful communications satellite. The passive spacecraft reflected telephone, radio and television signals between distant points on Earth. It also helped NASA study atmospheric density, solar pressure and satellite triangulation before re-entering Earth’s atmosphere in 1968.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/on-this-day-in-space-nasa-launched-the-100-foot-echo-1a-balloon-on-august-12-1960-the-passive-satellite-reflected-telephone-radio-and-television-signals-across-earth/articleshow/133149673.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/on-this-day-in-space-nasa-launched-the-100-foot-echo-1a-balloon-on-august-12-1960-the-passive-satellite-reflected-telephone-radio-and-television-signals-across-earth/articleshow/133149673.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T00:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133151572,imgsize-70584.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Kobe Bryant: "I have nothing in common with lazy people who blame others for…"]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133161188.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-kobe-bryant-