e after a staff member accidentally aired pre-recorded statements prepared for such an event. The broadcast included the national anthem and 16 minutes of silence before regular programming resumed. Ofcom ruled that the station breached broadcast standards over the inaccurate report and delayed correction.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/king-charles-death-falsely-announced-followed-by-national-anthem-and-16-minutes-of-silence-uk-radio-station-breached-broadcast-standards/articleshow/133160187.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/king-charles-death-falsely-announced-followed-by-national-anthem-and-16-minutes-of-silence-uk-radio-station-breached-broadcast-standards/articleshow/133160187.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-11T22:02:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133160319,imgsize-72683.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Solar eclipse craze grips UK: Brits stuck in hours-long queues as glasses fly off shelves]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133161829.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/solar-eclipse-craze-grips-uk-brits-stuck-in-hours-long-queues-as-glasses-fly-off-shelves/articleshow/133161829.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/solar-eclipse-craze-grips-uk-brits-stuck-in-hours-long-queues-as-glasses-fly-off-shelves/articleshow/133161829.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-11T23:09:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133162101,imgsize-175664.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Putin's vacation home exposed to attac